      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Fixação. Gothita normalmente é muito inocente. Quando observa algo invisível, permanece imóvel, sem piscar e completamente em silêncio. Não toque nas antenas em forma de laço que controlam seus poderes psíquicos, ou ela começará a chorar.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 25% M / 75% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Gothita pode evoluir para Gothorita no nível 11 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Confusion, Pound</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Play Nice, Tickle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Fake Tears</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Double Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Embargo</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Feint Attack, Hypnosis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Psyshock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Flatter</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Future Sight, Heal Block, Psych Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Psychic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Telekinesis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Charm, Magic Room</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Ally Switch, Attract, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Charm, Confide, Covet, Dark Pulse, Double Team, Dream Eater, Embargo, Endure, Energy Ball, Expanding Force, Facade, Fake Tears, Fling, Foul Play, Frustration, Future Sight, Grass Knot, Gravity, Guard Swap, Heal Bell, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Imprison, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Magic Room, Nasty Plot, Payback, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Noise, Psychic Terrain, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Role Play, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Stored Power, Substitute, Swagger, Swift, Taunt, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Torment, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Uproar, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Captivate, Dark Pulse, Fake Out, Heal Pulse, Mean Look, Miracle Eye, Mirror Coat, Torment, Uproar</p>",
